                {
                  "text": "This calculation is an application of the biological concept in syllabus 13.1(6); it does not have a separate calculation outcome. Use the quantities and units supplied in this question and round only the final result.",
                  "refs": [
                    "syllabus:13.1(6)"
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "reasoningChain": [
                "Measure both distances from the origin.",
                "Compare ratios rather than absolute distances between different chromatograms."
